  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 22988075008
    m_Localized: Worn Sharpening Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046528
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of all towers by <color=#FF4545>[2]</color>.\nIt shows
      its age, but the edge is still razor-sharp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046529
    m_Localized: Commander's Banner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046530
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of all towers by <color=#FF4545>[3]</color>.\nBoosts
      the morale of allies from the heart of the battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046531
    m_Localized: Royal Decree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046532
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of Human towers by <color=#FF4545>[4]</color>.\nUnder
      the strict imperial discipline, humans unite to strengthen the flow of battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046533
    m_Localized: World Tree's Leaf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046534
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of Elf towers by <color=#FF4545>[4]</color>.\nThe
      mystical energy of nature dwells within the Elves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046535
    m_Localized: WarCry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046536
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of Orc towers by <color=#FF4545>[4]</color>.\nA fierce
      roar awakens the primal instincts of the warriors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046537
    m_Localized: Feral Instinct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046538
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of Werebeast towers by <color=#FF4545>[4]</color>.\nSharp
      instincts allow them to strike at the enemy's weak points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046539
    m_Localized: Dragon Bone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046540
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of Dragonian towers by <color=#FF4545>[4]</color>.\nEssence
      extracted from dragon bones empowers Dragonians to become more like true dragons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046541
    m_Localized: Steel Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046542
    m_Localized: Increases ATK of Dwarf towers by <color=#FF4545>[4]</color>.\nThe
      steel core hardens the Dwarves, the children of the earth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046543
    m_Localized: Haste's Rune Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046544
    m_Localized: Increases ATK Speed of all towers by <color=#FF4545>[2]</color>.\nThe
      flow of mana makes your fingertips feel light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046545
    m_Localized: Haste's Rune Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046546
    m_Localized: Increases ATK Speed of all towers by <color=#FF4545>[4]</color>.\nA
      more powerful surge of mana swirls across the battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046547
    m_Localized: Master's Blueprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046548
    m_Localized: Reduces skill trigger requirements for all towers by <color=#FF4545>[1]</color>.\nEfficient
      design allows for faster skill usage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046549
    m_Localized: Lucky Coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046550
    m_Localized: Increases Gold gained upon killing an enemy by <color=#FF4545>[1]</color>.\nThe
      Goddess of Luck is watching over you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046551
    m_Localized: Lucky Coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046552
    m_Localized: Increases Gold gained upon killing an enemy by <color=#FF4545>[2]</color>.\nThe
      Goddess of Luck looks into your pockets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046553
    m_Localized: Small Potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046554
    m_Localized: Immediately restores <color=#FF4545>[3]</color> Life.\nA common
      potion that gently soothes wounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046555
    m_Localized: Middle Potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046556
    m_Localized: Immediately restores <color=#FF4545>[5]</color> Life.\nA potion
      carefully brewed by a professional alchemist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046557
    m_Localized: Large Potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046558
    m_Localized: Immediately restores <color=#FF4545>[10]</color> Life.\nA rare elixir
      brewed by a master alchemist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046559
    m_Localized: Treasure Pouch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046560
    m_Localized: Immediately grants a random amount of Gold (Max <color=#FF4545>[15]</color>).\nIts
      heavy weight is a sign of good things to come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046561
    m_Localized: Merchant's Ledger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046562
    m_Localized: Increases the maximum bonus interest at the end of a wave by <color=#FF4545>[10]</color>.\nMeticulous
      records lead to efficient asset management.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046563
    m_Localized: Merchant's Ledger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046564
    m_Localized: Increases the maximum bonus interest at the end of a wave by <color=#FF4545>[20]</color>.\nThe
      market's capital flows directly to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046565
    m_Localized: Membership Card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046566
    m_Localized: Expands Tower Queue slots by <color=#FF4545>[1]</color>.\nAllows
      for more strategic tower preparation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046567
    m_Localized: Expansion Blueprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046568
    m_Localized: Expands Market Sales slots by <color=#FF4545>[1]</color>.\nA wider
      variety of items now arrive at the market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046569
    m_Localized: Human
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046570
    m_Localized: Elf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046571
    m_Localized: Dwarf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046572
    m_Localized: Orc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046573
    m_Localized: Dragonian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046574
    m_Localized: Were Beast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046575
    m_Localized: Golden Prosperity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046576
    m_Localized: 'The hegemony of gold that moves the world pulses even more powerfully
      at the humans'' fingertips.\nOwn Human Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} /
      {2} / {3}]</color>\nIncreases Interest Rate by <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} /
      {6} / {7}]%p</color> at the end of the round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046577
    m_Localized: Spiritual Resonance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046578
    m_Localized: 'The mystical energy of nature connects spirits and Elves as one.\nOwn
      Elf Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3}]</color>\nIncreases ATK of
      all Elf towers by <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} / {6} / {7}]</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046579
    m_Localized: Armor Breaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046580
    m_Localized: 'Dwarven precision strikes pierce through the enemy''s toughest
      parts.\nOwn Dwarf Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2}]</color>\nReduces
      enemy Defense by <color=#FF4545>[{3} / {4} / {5}]%</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046581
    m_Localized: Horde's Pressure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046582
    m_Localized: 'With a fierce roar, the Orcs'' overwhelming power crushes the battlefield.\nOwn
      Orc Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3}]</color>\nIncreases ATK by
      <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} / {6} / {7}]</color> (Step.4: Applies <color=#45A2FF>Slow</color>
      on attack).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046583
    m_Localized: Draconic Might
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046584
    m_Localized: 'Ancient split dragon factors pulse hotly within the veins of Dragonians.\nOwn
      Dragonian Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3} / {4} / {5}]</color>\nIncreases
      ATK of all Dragonian towers by <color=#FF4545>[{6} / {7} / {8} / {9} / {10}
      / {11}]</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046585
    m_Localized: Predator's Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046586
    m_Localized: 'The Werebeast''s eyes, flashing even in the dark, never miss their
      prey.\nOwn Werebeast Towers: <color=#FF4545>[{0} / {1} / {2} / {3}]</color>\nIncreases
      Critical Chance by <color=#FF4545>[{4} / {5} / {6} / {7}]%p</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046587
    m_Localized: None Skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046588
    m_Localized: Has no special abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046589
    m_Localized: Vital Regen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046590
    m_Localized: 'Recovers {4} HP of self. (Cooldown: {1}s)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046591
    m_Localized: Heal Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046592
    m_Localized: 'Deploys a sanctuary for {0}s, recovering {4} HP of allies within
      {3} range every {2}s. (Cooldown: {1}s)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046593
    m_Localized: Limit Break
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046594
    m_Localized: 'Unleashes potential to increase Move Speed by {4}% for {0}s. (Cooldown:
      {1}s)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23009046595
